THIRD-PARTY CODE

This distribution contains no third-party code. The library has no runtime
dependencies.

The stream format's even token split is layout-compatible with the LZ4 block
format, and the library can read LZ4 blocks. No LZ4 source code is included,
derived from, or linked at runtime; the compatibility is with the format as
published, and the decoder for it was written from scratch.

The optional `liblz4` build feature links the system LZ4 library, which is
used only by the comparison benchmarks and the interop test. It is not
required to build or use this library, and nothing in a released binary
depends on it.
